foreach (['featured', 'current', 'upcoming', 'finished'] as $b) foreach (['x', 'y'] as $ax) $bS["position_{$b}_$ax"] = (float) ($settings["position_{$b}_$ax"] ?? 0);
foreach (['accent_color', 'text_color', 'font_family', 'box_layout', 'preview_canvas', 'image_fit'] as $k) $bS[$k] = (string) ($settings[$k] ?? '');
echo json_encode(['success' => true, 'has_key' => (string) $makerApiKey !== '', 'media_base' => $mediaBase, 'settings' => $bS], JSON_UNESCAPED_UNICODE);
